@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@token = paste_access_token_here

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login (use a real account from tbl_users)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "your-username-or-email",
  "password": "your-password",
  "deviceName": "Local Development",
  "forceLogout": false
}

### List employees (requires Navarachna access token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employees?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
